/* The guild war boards' modern look (the reviewed WGuildWar board of stage
   1): a column of small panels 10dp from the left and 50dp from the
   bottom, the first war at the bottom and each later one above it, 4dp
   apart. A board holds the two guilds' rows, 4dp apart: each a sunken
   26dp cell with the guild's mark (16 x 12, framed), its name 30dp in and
   its score in a badge at the row's end; the leading guild's row (the
   higher score) on the selection fill with an accent edge, its score in
   the accent. Its width follows its longest row, 160dp at least (legacy computes
   30 + longest name * 6 + 40). Classic (the thin board, 50dp tall, the
   marks at 10, 10 + 18k and the texts at 30, 10 + 18k, uiguild.py:396-428):
   skins/classic/windows/guild-war.rcss. */

body.guild-war
{
	focus: none;
	tab-index: none;
}
.guild-war__column
{
	display: flex;
	flex-direction: column;
	align-items: flex-start;
	gap: 4dp;
	position: absolute;
	left: 10dp;
	bottom: 50dp;
}
.guild-war__slot
{
	display: block;
}
.nui-panel.guild-war__board
{
	display: block;
	min-width: 160dp;
	padding: 9dp 10dp;
	font-size: var(--font-md);
	font-weight: bold;
	color: var(--text);
}
.guild-war__row-slot
{
	display: block;
	margin-bottom: var(--space-1);
}
.guild-war__row-slot:last-child
{
	margin-bottom: 0;
}
.guild-war__row
{
	display: flex;
	flex-direction: row;
	align-items: center;
	position: relative;
	box-sizing: border-box;
	height: 26dp;
	padding-left: 30dp;
	padding-right: 2dp;
	border-width: 1dp;
	border-color: var(--border);
	border-radius: 6dp;
	background-color: var(--surface-sunken);
	line-height: 24dp;
	white-space: nowrap;
}
/* Legacy's one text ("name score") is the classic look's; here the name
   and the score show apart. */
.guild-war__text
{
	display: none;
}
.guild-war__name
{
	display: block;
	flex: 1 1 auto;
	min-width: 0;
	overflow: hidden;
	text-overflow: ellipsis;
}
/* The score: a small badge in the row's end, the board's well color. */
.guild-war__score
{
	display: block;
	flex: 0 0 auto;
	box-sizing: border-box;
	min-width: 28dp;
	height: 20dp;
	margin-left: var(--space-2);
	padding: 0 5dp;
	border-width: 1dp;
	border-color: var(--border);
	border-radius: 5dp;
	background-color: var(--surface);
	font-size: 13dp;
	line-height: 18dp;
	text-align: center;
}
/* The leading guild: the selection fill and a 2dp accent edge (its
   padding 1dp narrower, so the mark and the name stay put), its score in
   the accent. */
.guild-war__row.is-leading
{
	padding-left: 29dp;
	border-left-width: 2dp;
	border-left-color: var(--accent);
	background-color: var(--selection);
}
.guild-war__row.is-leading .guild-war__mark
{
	left: 5dp;
}
.guild-war__row.is-leading .guild-war__score
{
	color: var(--accent);
}
/* The mark, framed by a dark hairline. */
.guild-war__mark
{
	position: absolute;
	left: 6dp;
	top: 5dp;
	width: 16dp;
	height: 12dp;
	border-width: 1dp;
	border-color: var(--overlay-scrim);
	border-radius: 2dp;
}
